{'symbol': 'C', 'date': '2022-06-02 16:05:00', 'title': 'DATADOG APPOINTS TITI COLE TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': "NEW YORK\xa0, JUNE 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DATADOG, INC. (NASDAQ: DDOG),\xa0THE MONITORING AND SECURITY PLATFORM FOR CLOUD APPLICATIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF CITIGROUP'S (NYSE: C) TITI COLE TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS. COLE IS CITIGROUP'S CEO OF LEGACY FRANCHISES, OVERSEEING THE BANK'S CONSUMER BUSINESS IN ASIA, EUROPE, MIDDLE EAST, AFRICA AND MEXICO."}